---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Container from '@/components/ui/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '@/components/ui/WhatsAppButton.astro';
import OrganicShape from '@/components/ui/OrganicShape.astro';
import DecorativeAsset from '@/components/ui/DecorativeAsset.astro';
import heroPhoto from '@/assets/photos/hero-portrait.jpg';
---

<section id="hero" class="relative overflow-hidden pb-24 pt-[140px] md:pb-32 md:pt-[168px]">
  <!-- Lateral margin accent - only the true page gutter, well clear of the
       headline/CTA column, first appearance of the "decorated edge" motif
       repeated (with different assets/scale) further down the page. Rooted
       at the section's bottom edge rather than floating mid-air. -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute left-4 bottom-0 hidden w-32 opacity-80 xl:block"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <DecorativeAsset
      variant="tulip-closed-beige"
      widthPx={460}
      class="h-auto w-full rotate-[-10deg]"
    />
  </div>

  <Container class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-6">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1 md:col-span-7">
      <SectionHeading
        as="h1"
        size="hero"
        data-hero-item
        style="--stagger-index: 0;"
        class="max-w-[16ch]"
      >
        Psicoterapia para mulheres com ansiedade
      </SectionHeading>

      <p
        data-hero-item
        style="--stagger-index: 1;"
        class="mt-6 max-w-[52ch] font-body text-body-lg text-muted"
      >
        Para você que aprendeu a dar conta de tudo, mas sente que a sua mente nunca desacelera.
        Um espaço de acolhimento e escuta, com base na Terapia Cognitivo-Comportamental e em evidências científicas, para ajudar você a compreender a ansiedade, lidar com pensamentos que te sobrecarregam e viver com mais leveza.
      </p>

      <div data-hero-item style="--stagger-index: 2;" class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
        <WhatsAppButton context="hero" />
        <span class="font-body text-small italic text-muted">
          Atendimento psicológico individual • Online
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative order-1 md:order-2 md:col-span-5">
      <div
        data-hero-photo
        style="--stagger-index: 1;"
        class="relative -mx-5 md:mx-0 md:ml-auto md:w-[92%] md:translate-y-0"
      >
        <Image
          src={heroPhoto}
          alt="Gabrielle Favere, psicóloga"
          width={900}
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
          class="aspect-[5/4] w-full rounded-image-lg object-cover object-[45%_25%] md:aspect-[4/5] md:mask-organic-1 md:object-[45%_18%] md:-mb-16 lg:-mb-24"
        />
      </div>

      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-6 left-2 flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center md:left-6 md:h-28 md:w-28"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <OrganicShape
          variant="rose-deep"
          trimmed
          widthPx={240}
          loading="eager"
          class="h-auto w-[76px] rotate-[-6deg] md:w-[92px]"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
